Description:It is your first main phase. Earthshaker Khenra (2/1 haste; when it enters, target creature with power less than or equal to its power can't block this turn; eternalize {4}{R}{R}) is in your graveyard, with six red mana floating. The opponent is at 4 life and controls an untapped Hill Giant (3/3). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-eternalize-4-4 | Eternalize creates a token copy that is a 4/4 black Zombie (CR 702.129a, 707.9b): the token has haste, and its enters trigger checks its power 4, so the Hill Giant (power 3) can't block and 4 damage connects; the printed 2/1 could not have targeted the Giant
